          "name": "face",
          "atlas": "fast_face.json",
          "order": 1,
          "rotates": false
        }
      ],
      "note": "dart, feet, shine and the death burst. The art points down (+y), so rotate it by (look - PI/2), look = atan2(tower.y - e.y, tower.x - e.x); that equals cartoon.js's rotate(look + PI/2) of its tip-up dart. Draw every atlas in 'set' in 'order' (0 first) with the same animation and frame index, each at the entity position + frames[name].offset (screen space, frame px: the walk bob, applied after any rotation); they share sourceSize, pivot and timing."
    },
